&lt;ol style=&quot;margin-top:0cm&quot; start=&quot;1&quot; type=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
 &lt;li class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;text-align:justify;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;
     mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none&quot;&gt;The proposal, by reason of insufficient
     information on the future uses of the proposed pitches and their need, fails
     to demonstrate that the proposed loss of playing fields and designated open
     space would be replaced by equivalent or better provision in terms of
     quantity and quality and that the community benefits of the proposal would
     clearly outweigh the former use, contrary to the National Planning Policy
     Framework (2023), policy S5 of The London Plan (2021) and Policy DM48 of Harrow
     Development Management Polices Local Plan (2013).&amp;nbsp;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;

&lt;ol style=&quot;margin-top:0cm&quot; start=&quot;1&quot; type=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
 &lt;li class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;text-align:justify;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;
     mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none&quot;&gt;&lt;ol style=&quot;margin-top:0cm&quot; start=&quot;1&quot; type=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
 &lt;li class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;text-align:justify;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;
     tab-stops:list 36.0pt;text-autospace:none&quot;&gt;The proposal, by reason of its siting within a Flood
     Storage Reservoir Basin and provision of an unsatisfactory Flood Risk
     Assessment and Surface Water Drainage Strategy, would cause harm to the flood storage area and the
     fluvial storage capacity on site and fails to demonstrate that the proposed development
     would not exacerbate the risk of flooding within the site or increase the
     risk and consequences of flooding elsewhere from both fluvial and surface
     water sources, to the detriment of the safety of the adjoining occupiers
     and land and the future users of the development, contrary to the National
     Planning Policy Framework (2023), policies SI12 and SI13 of the London
     Plan (2021), Core Policy CS1 U of Harrow Core Strategy (2012) and policies
     DM 9, DM 10 and DM 18 of the Harrow Development Management Polices Local
     Plan (2013).&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
